/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (Welcomem to Porto, a city shaped by its prosperous port wine trade that flourished in the 18th century, especially with the arrival of English merchants who established renowned companies like Sandeman and Offley, bypassing intermediaries. Unlike Lisbon, which suffered significant damage from the 1755 earthquake, Porto remained intact, allowing its rich heritage to be beautifully preserved.)
